== tree
document test/golden/notation.tekx
  meta@2 notation tex
  para@4 0
    text In LaTeX 
    math@4:11 a_{ij}
    text  is a subscript, 
    math@4:36 ABCD
    text  is four letters, 
    math@4:60 xy
    text  a product, and 
    math@5:2 \left( a_{ij} \right)
    text  the same; 
    math@5:36 x^{-1/2}
    text  has an exponent of 
    math@5:66 -1/2
    text , and 
    math@6:2 1/\log x
    text  divides by a logarithm.
  display@8
    line@8:5 - \sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}.
